{"unit_id":"JessenReinhart__dsh-time-context#card-zh","repo":"JessenReinhart/dsh-time-context","commit":"7c4b481facab50ae73feaa503dcb2ddea39570b7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-time-context 是为 DSH 增加时间感知上下文的插件，通过 systemPrompt 的动态上下文和稳定提示规则，把当前本地日期、时刻、星期、时区与时段，以及上一条用户消息的时间、日期关系和间隔自动加入模型请求。它监听用户消息事件并在本地记录时间状态，支持跨会话和重启后的连续性；还提供 /time 命令查看当前注入内容。适合需要模型理解“昨晚”“今天早些时候”等相对时间表达的 DSH Desktop 用户。运行需要 Node.js 20 或更新版本，并在用户主目录保存状态文件；代码未配置外部服务或 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:25-28","lib/index.js:107-159","lib/index.js:169-176"]}
{"unit_id":"JessenReinhart__dsh-time-context#card-en","repo":"JessenReinhart/dsh-time-context","commit":"7c4b481facab50ae73feaa503dcb2ddea39570b7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-time-context adds the current local date, time and timezone, plus the previous user message time and elapsed gap, to DSH prompts. It saves message state locally across sessions and offers /time to display the context. Requires Node.js 20+; no API key or external service is declared.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:25-28","lib/index.js:107-159","lib/index.js:169-176"]}
